{
  "_doc": "The goddesses' reaction table (builtin_ai.md 8.7; catalog_goddess_interventions.md 6), the rows the M1 kernel can raise. For one event every goddess who perceives it reads her own rows first and the shared rows (goddess *) second, and fires the highest priority row that holds; a shared row beats her own only with a higher priority. `when` is a world condition (reveal-ledger syntax); `cond` joins predicates of src/systems/goddess/brain/reactions.ts with AND (a leading ! negates; `tier.<id>` names a tier of offerings.json); `then` lists the effects in order. `once: day` is the catalog's once a day per goddess.",
